    <data key="d0">Decomposing Data Monolith with AWS Purpose-Built Databases and KMS Encryption</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kWxymroGeE</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing how OutSystems decomposes monolith data into S3, Aurora, DynamoDB, and Secrets Manager with multi-tenant KMS encryption.</data>
    <data key="d3">Database &amp; Storage Monolith Decomposition</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
